<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with TIME AGGREGATION by year:
<aggregateBy key="Year"/> collapses the hours (PreAggDAY.sql), the day types
(PreAggMONTH.sql) and then the months (PreAggYEAR.sql: MonthOfAnyYear 0 "Whole
Year" of 365 days, ZoneMonthHour by MonthWeighting, MonthGroupHour, FuelSupply
and ATRatio by MonthGroupWeighting, MonthVMTFraction 1, StartsMonthAdjust and
HotellingMonthAdjust 1, TotalIdleFraction by MonthWeightingBySourceType)
before any generator runs, and <outputtimestep value="Year"/>. January, April,
July and October 2020 (month keys are 0-based), both day types, all 24 hours.
Selections as scale-county-timeagg-month plus crankcase running and extended
idle, brake and tire wear PM, and running Total Energy and Atmospheric CO2;
no evaporative or refueling process. County database
county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql.]]></description>
